[{"title":"正气歌","author":"文天祥","text":"天地有正气，杂然赋流形。\n下则为河岳，上则为日星。\n于人曰浩然，沛乎塞苍冥。\n皇路当清夷，含和吐明庭。\n时穷节乃见，一一垂丹青。\n在齐太史简，在晋董狐笔。\n在秦张良椎，在汉苏武节。\n为严将军头，为嵇侍中血。\n为张睢阳齿，为颜常山舌。\n或为辽东帽，清操厉冰雪。\n或为出师表，鬼神泣壮烈。\n或为渡江楫，慷慨吞胡羯。\n或为击贼笏，逆竖头破裂。\n是气所旁薄，凛烈万古存。\n当其贯日月，生死安足论。\n地维赖以立，天柱赖以尊。\n三纲实系命，道义为之根。\n嗟予遘阳九，隶也实不力。\n楚囚缨其冠，传车送穷北。\n鼎镬甘如饴，求之不可得。\n阴房阒鬼火，春院閟天黑。\n牛骥同一皂，鸡栖凤凰食。\n一朝濛雾露，分作沟中瘠。\n如此再寒暑，百沴自辟易。\n嗟哉沮洳场，为我安乐国。\n岂有他缪巧，阴阳不能贼。\n顾此耿耿在，仰视浮云白。\n悠悠我心悲，苍天曷有极。\n哲人日已远，典刑在夙昔。\n风檐展书读，古道照颜色。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6152,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"母第一百四十一","author":"文天祥","text":"何时太夫人，上天回哀眷。\n墓久狐兔邻，呜呼泪如霰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6153,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"生日","author":"文天祥","text":"忆昔闲居日，端二逢始生。\n升堂拜亲寿，抠衣接宾荣。\n载酒出郊去，江花相送迎。\n诗歌和盈轴，铿戛金石声。\n于时果何时，朝野方休明。\n人生足自乐，帝力无能名。\n譬如江海鱼，与水俱忘情。\n讵知君父恩，天地同生成。\n旄头忽堕地，氛雾迷三精。\n黄屋朔风捲，园林杀气平。\n四海靡所骋，三年老于行。\n宾僚半荡覆，妻子同飘零。\n无几哭慈母，有顷遭溃兵。\n束兵献穹帐，囚首送空囹。\n痛甚衣冠烈，甘于鼎镬烹。\n死生久已定，宠辱安足惊。\n不图坐罗网，四见槐云青。\n朱颜日复少，玄发益以星。\n往事真蕉鹿，浮名一草萤。\n牢愁写玄语，初度感骚经。\n朝登蓬莱门，暮涉芙蓉城。\n忽复临故国，摇摇我心旌。\n想见家下人，念我涕为倾。\n交朋说畴昔，惆怅鸡豚盟。\n空花从何来，为吾舞娉婷。\n莫道无人歌，时鸟不可听。\n达人贵知命，俗士空劳形。\n吾生复安适，拄颊观苍冥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6154,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"生日和谢爱山长句","author":"文天祥","text":"寓形落落大块间，嘘吸一气自往还。\n桑弧未了男子事，何能局促甘囚山。\n昔年此日作初度，宾客如云剧欢舞。\n今年避影却闭门，捧觞自寿白头母。\n故人忆我能远来，虹光满袖生琼瑰。\n一杯相属慰岑寂，使我发笑愁颜开。\n簸扬且听箕张口，丈夫壮气须冲斗。\n夜阑拂剑碧光寒，握手相期出云表。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6155,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"生日谢朱约山和来韵","author":"文天祥","text":"元丰五年正月日，洛中耆英佳话出。\n当时韩公七十九，欢噱赓酬老吟笔。\n伟然冠剑照孔鸾，鲐背鸠杖蒲轮安。\n韩公而下文宽夫，相高以寿不以官。\n洛尘已随流水急，云仍相逢松下石。\n顾我行辈真我来，兼谟故事强安排。\n约对青山共长久，醉歌要赛滁州守。\n愿随后社著深衣，阑风伏雨从是非。\n便令携樽西墅去，山花山鸟为歌舞。\n招招瑶母来庭闱，拍手共笑偷桃儿。\n吾山陂陀白云满，猿鹤司我北门管。\n紫霞隔断鸡犬声，下有琥珀滋长龄。\n向来福地七十二，此亦清高仙地位。\n朝游昆崙暮崆峒，驾风鞭霆迎我公。\n丹崖翠壁千万丈，与公上上上上上。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6156,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用前人韵招山行以春为期","author":"文天祥","text":"扫残竹径随人坐，凿破苔矶到处棋。\n一水楼台开晓镜，万山花木放春闱。\n雪中便有回舟兴，林下岂无烧笋时。\n莫待东风吹柳絮，眼穿笼鹤绕湖飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6157,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白沟河","author":"文天祥","text":"昔时张叔夜，统兵赴勤王。\n东都一不守，羸马迁龙荒。\n适过白沟河，裂眦须欲张。\n绝粒不遄死，仰天扼其吭。\n群臣总奄奄，一土垂天光。\n读史识其地，抚卷为凄凉。\n我生何不辰，异世忽相望。\n皇图遘阳九，天堑满飞堭。\n引兵诣阙下，捧土障澜狂。\n出使义不屈，持节还中郎。\n六飞独南海，金钺将煌煌。\n武侯空威心，出狩惊四方。\n吾属竟为虏，世事吁彼苍。\n思公有奇节，一死何慨慷。\n江淮我分地，我欲投沧浪。\n沧浪却不受，中原行路长。\n初登项籍宫，次览刘季邦。\n涉足河与济，回首嵩与恒。\n下车抚梁门，上马指楼桑。\n戴星渡一水，惨淡天微茫。\n行人为我言，宋辽此分疆。\n悬知公死处，为公出涕滂。\n恨不持束刍，徘徊官道傍。\n我死还在燕，烈烈同肝肠。\n今我为公哀，后来谁我伤。\n天地垂日月，斯人未云亡。\n文武道不坠，我辈终堂堂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6158,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白髭行","author":"文天祥","text":"忆昔守宣时，白上一根发。\n去之四五年，一化为七八。\n今年客衡湘，黑髭已多黄。\n众黄忽一白，惊见如陵阳。\n白发已为常，白髭何足怪。\n岁月不可歇，雪霜日长大。\n世人竞染缁，厌之固足嗤。\n谁服芦菔汤，避老亦奚为。\n少老如春秋，造物以为俦。\n吾方乐吾天，乐天故不忧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6159,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"先两国初忌","author":"文天祥","text":"北风吹黄花，落木寒萧飕。\n哀哀我慈母，玉化炎海秋。\n日月水东流，音容隔悠悠。\n小祥哭下邳，大祥哭幽州。\n今此复何夕，荏苒三星周。\n嗟哉不肖孤，宗职旷不修。\n昔母肉未寒，委身堕寇雠。\n仰药早云遂，庶从地下游。\n太阿落人手，死生不自由。\n南冠坐绝域，大期落淹流。\n白华下玄发，碧苏生缁裘。\n心口自相语，形影旁无俦。\n空庭鬼火阒，天黑对牢愁。\n鱼轩在何处，魂魄今安否。\n儿女各北归，坟墓委南陬。\n寒食雨凄凄，盂饭谁与投。\n荆棘缠蔓草，狐兔缘荒丘。\n长夜良寂寞，与我同幽幽。\n我心亦劳止，我命实不犹。\n昨夕梦堂上，乐昔欢绸缪。\n觉来尚恍惚，血涕连衾裯。\n晨兴一瓣香，痛如螫在头。\n吾家白云下，万里同关忧。\n遥怜弟与妹，几筵罗庶羞。\n既伤母在殡，又念兄在囚。\n兄囚不足念，毋亦为母谋。\n三圣去已远，穹垠莽洪流。\n缅怀百世虑，白骨甘填沟。\n冥冥先大夫，郁郁苍松楸。\n防山迄合葬，瞑目复何求。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6160,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"刘钦贡元第一百一十二","author":"文天祥","text":"文章日自负，去家死路傍。\n高视见霸王，感子故意长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6161,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"刘琨","author":"文天祥","text":"中原荡分崩，壮哉刘越石。\n连踪起幽并，只手扶晋室。\n福华天意乘，匹磾生鬼蜮。\n公死百世名，天下分南北。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6162,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"则堂 其一","author":"文天祥","text":"山河四塞旧瓯金，艺祖高宗实鉴临。\n一日尽将输敌手，何人卖国独甘心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6163,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吉州第八十二","author":"文天祥","text":"戚戚去故里，我生苦飘零。\n回身视绿野，但见西岭青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6164,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"名姝吟","author":"文天祥","text":"丈夫至白首，钟鼎垂功名。\n未有朱门中，而无丝竹声。\n与主共富贵，不见主苦辛。\n名姝从何来，婉娈出神京。\n京人薄生男，生女即不贫。\n东家从王侯，西家事公卿。\n吾行天下多，朱紫稀晨星。\n大都不一一，甚者旷数城。\n如何世上福，冉冉归娉婷。\n乃知长安市，家家生贵人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6165,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吕武第一百一十三","author":"文天祥","text":"疾恶怀刚肠，世人皆欲杀。\n魂魄犹正直，回首肝肺热。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6166,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吸江","author":"文天祥","text":"绝壁千寻俯雪潭，春花秋草有䰐鬖。\n当年误著蒲团坐，惹得人称马祖岩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6167,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"安庆府第十三","author":"文天祥","text":"岸转异江湖，江水流城郭。\n鸱鸮志意满，山鬼独一脚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6168,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"巩宣使信第一百一十四","author":"文天祥","text":"壮士血相视，斯人已云亡。\n哀哀失木狖，夜深经战场。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6169,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏马台","author":"文天祥","text":"九月初九日，客游戏马台。\n黄花弄朝露，古人花飞埃。\n今人哀后人，后人复今哀。\n世事那可及，泪落茱萸杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6170,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扬州地分官 其一","author":"文天祥","text":"五骑驰来号徼巡，咆哮按剑一何嗔。\n金钱买命方无语，何必豺狼骂北人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6171,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扬州第二十六","author":"文天祥","text":"城峻随天壁，胡来但自守。\n士卒终倒戟，仰望嗟叹久。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6172,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有感","author":"文天祥","text":"海阔龙深蛰，山空鸟杂鸣。\n花随春共去，云与水俱行。\n壮士千年志，征夫万里程。\n夜凉看星斗，何处是搀枪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6173,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有感","author":"文天祥","text":"石郎草草割山川，一落人手三百年。\n八州风雨暗连天，三皇五帝如飞烟。\n人人野祭伊水边，春秋断烂不复传。\n白头潦倒今鲁连，夜深危坐日晏眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6174,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有感呈景山校书诸丈","author":"文天祥","text":"北风吹春草，阳乌日已至。\n天时岂云爽，人事胡乃异。\n三月方皇皇，衣冠道如坠。\n栋挠榱桷折，木颠桢干悴。\n大者怀端忧，燋头求室燬。\n小者嗟行役，泥涂跋其尾。\n长平与新安，露胔如栉比。\n赋分本尔殊，适与天时值。\n哲人处明夷，致命以遂志。\n但令守吾贞，死生浩无愧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6175,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次子第一百四十五","author":"文天祥","text":"渥洼骐骥儿，众中见毛骨。\n别来忽三岁，残害为异物。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6176,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次约山赋杏花韵","author":"文天祥","text":"名花韵在午晴初，雨沁胭脂脸更敷。\n蒲驿莫妨娱刺史，锦坊岂不胜中书。\n时无艳曲临轩纵，公莫巍坛韫匮沽。\n春老绿阴青子近，东风来往一吹嘘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6177,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江行第八十八","author":"文天祥","text":"连山暗烽燧，川谷血横流。\n挥泪临大江，上有行云愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6178,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江西第六十九","author":"文天祥","text":"旄头初俶扰，义士皆痛愤。\n乾坤空峥嵘，向者留遗恨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6179,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江西第六十八","author":"文天祥","text":"东望西江水，高义在云台。\n到今用钺地，霜鸿有馀哀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6180,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池州","author":"文天祥","text":"五老湖光远，九华山色昏。\n南冠前进士，北部故将军。\n芳草江头路，斜阳郭外村。\n匆匆十年梦，故国黯销魂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6181,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竹花","author":"文天祥","text":"黄家紫家斗魏姚，夷齐玉立青萧萧。\n便是人间小天地，不特水上作萍漂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6182,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪事 其四","author":"文天祥","text":"百色无厌不可支，甘心卖国问为谁。\n豺狼尚畏忠臣在，相戒勿令丞相知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6183,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自叹","author":"文天祥","text":"草宿披宵露，松餐立晚风。\n乱离嗟我在，艰苦有谁同。\n祖逖关河志，程婴社稷功。\n身谋百年事，宇宙浩无穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6184,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自叹","author":"文天祥","text":"功业羞前辈，形骸感故吾。\n屡判嵇绍血，几无庆公须。\n落落惟心在，苍苍有意无。\n江流总遗泪，何止失吞吴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6185,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自叹","author":"文天祥","text":"瑟瑟秋风悲，烈烈寒气骄。\n蒲柳先已零，松柏何后凋。\n天意重肃杀，造物无不销。\n强弱有异禀，忧患同一朝。\n惟有南山石，千载一岧峣。\n人苦不自足，空羡王子乔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6186,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自汶阳至郓","author":"文天祥","text":"渺渺中原道，劳生叹百非。\n风雨吹打人，泥泞飞上衣。\n目力去天短，心事与时违。\n夫子昔相鲁，侵疆自齐归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6187,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至广州第七十七","author":"文天祥","text":"南方瘴疠地，白马东北来。\n长城扫遗堞，泪落强徘徊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6188,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至吉州第八十","author":"文天祥","text":"挂帆远色外，缅邈怀旧丘。\n江水风萧萧，乌啼满城头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6189,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至南安军第七十八","author":"文天祥","text":"短日行梅岭，天门郁嵯峨。\n江西万里船，归期无柰何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6190,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至真州第五十九","author":"文天祥","text":"万里长江边，去国同王粲。\n青山意不尽，皇天照嗟叹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6191,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至温州","author":"文天祥","text":"晏岁著脚来东瓯，始觉坤轴东南浮。\n百川同归无异脉，有如天子朝诸侯。\n何年飞落两巨石，孤撑肮脏分江流。\n初疑鍊失女娲手，又疑钓脱任公钩。\n冯夷海若不敢有，涌出精舍如莲舟。\n楼高百尺蜃吐气，塔耸双角龙昂头。\n蒲牢撞撞鼍坎坎，潮声滚滚风飕飕。\n沙高峰顶德门住，海门山上焦公留。\n长淮在望铁瓮近，大浪不洗英雄愁。\n孰知隶古百粤地，今为礼乐衣冠州。\n池塘芳草年年绿，谢公胜事遗江楼。\n蓝田无颣蟾架夜，黄金作颗人家秋。\n客帆渺茫拂宸极，渔舠散漫轻凫鸥。\n丽天红日起初浴，五云扶上烟氛收。\n孤臣涕泗如此水，恨不从帝崆峒游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6192,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至福安第六十二","author":"文天祥","text":"握节汉臣回，麻鞋见天子。\n感激动四极，壮士泪如雨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6193,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至燕城第九十八","author":"文天祥","text":"百年不敢料，先后无丑好。\n绝境与谁同，飘泊南庭老。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6194,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"行府之败第七十四","author":"文天祥","text":"翠盖蒙尘飞，仗钺奋忠烈。\n千秋沧海南，事与云水白。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6195,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"行淮东第六十","author":"文天祥","text":"客子中夜发，月照白水山。\n悲辛但狂顾，浩荡前后间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6196,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西瓜吟","author":"文天祥","text":"拔出金佩刀，斫破苍玉瓶。\n千点红樱桃，一团黄水晶。\n下咽顿除烟火气，入齿便作冰雪声。\n长安清富说邵平，争如汉朝作公卿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6197,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"许远","author":"文天祥","text":"起师哭玄元，义气震天地。\n百战奋雄姿，脔妾士挥泪。\n睢阳水东流，双庙垂百世。\n当时令狐潮，乃为贼游说。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6198,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过临江第八十三","author":"文天祥","text":"独帆如飞鸿，清江转山急。\n回首白云多，山寒夜中泣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6199,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过淮河宿阚石有感","author":"文天祥","text":"北征垂半年，依依只南土。\n今晨渡淮河，始觉非故宇。\n江乡已无家，三年一羁旅。\n龙翔在何方，乃我妻子所。\n昔也无柰何，忽已置念虑。\n今行日已近，使我泪如雨。\n我为纲常谋，有身不得顾。\n妻兮莫望夫，子兮莫望父。\n天长与地久，此恨极千古。\n来生业缘在，骨肉当如故。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6200,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过隆兴第八十四","author":"文天祥","text":"临江久徘徊，再读徐孺碑。\n交游飒向尽，到今耆旧悲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6201,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过雪桥琉璃桥","author":"文天祥","text":"小桥度雪度琉璃，更有清霜滑马蹄。\n游子衣裳如铁冷，残星荒店野鸡啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6202,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"听罗道士琴 其一","author":"文天祥","text":"断崖千仞碧，下有寒泉落。\n道人挥丝桐，清风转寥廓。\n飘飘襟袂举，冰纨不禁薄。\n紫烟护丹霞，双舞天外鹤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6203,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"听罗道士琴 其二","author":"文天祥","text":"吾闻泗滨磬，暗含角与徵。\n又闻天乐泉，净洗筝笛耳。\n如何碧一泓，乃此并二美。\n蓝田沧海意，请问玉溪子。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6204,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"坟墓第一百三十九","author":"文天祥","text":"别离已五年，不及祖父茔。\n霜露晚凄凄，痛哭松声回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6205,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"弟第一百五十一","author":"文天祥","text":"兄弟分离苦，凄凉忆去年。\n何以有羽翼，飞去堕尔前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6206,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"弟第一百五十二","author":"文天祥","text":"棣华晴雨好，风急手足寒。\n百战今谁在，羁栖见汝难。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6207,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"张世杰第四十二","author":"文天祥","text":"长风驾高浪，偃蹇龙虎姿。\n萧条犹在否，寒日出雾迟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6208,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"张制置珏第五十一","author":"文天祥","text":"气敌万人将，独在天一隅。\n向使国不亡，功业竟何如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6209,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀孔明","author":"文天祥","text":"斜谷事不济，将星殒营中。\n至今出师表，读之泪沾胸。\n汉贼明大义，赤心贯苍穹。\n世以成败论，操懿真英雄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6210,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀旧第一百九","author":"文天祥","text":"中夜怀友朋，百年见存没。\n风吹苍江树，寒月照白骨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6211,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀旧第一百八","author":"文天祥","text":"故人入我梦，相视涕阑干。\n四海一涂炭，焉用身独完。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6212,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀忠襄","author":"文天祥","text":"平生王佐心，世运蹈衰末。\n齐虏谁复封，楚囚讵当脱。\n金陵虽怀古，尚友在风烈。\n褒忠侈遗庙，夫子我先达。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6213,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]